cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Fidetype, please cite it with the metadata in this file."
type: software
title: "Fidetype: an open trust layer for neural text entry"
abstract: >-
  Fidetype is an open, decoder-agnostic trust layer for neural text entry.
  It defines the NeuralTextStream format for the output of any neural input
  decoder, and it calibrates, abstains and flags hallucinated text.
authors:
